        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/43621</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/43621"/>
        <updated>2026-03-31T12:00:16.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">FF150 adds support for <code class="notranslate">CSSFontFaceRule.style</code> being a <code class="notranslate">CSSFontFaceDescriptors</code>. This adds a release note and minor updates to docs.</p>
